@host = http://localhost:5108
@admin = dev-admin-key

### Chinese direct answer
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"siteCode":"demo","message":"如何註冊 Acme Store 帳號？","locale":"zh-TW"}

